{"type":"message","id":"a12678c4","parentId":"1fb7d5aa","timestamp":"2026-03-13T03:47:26.984Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"ClawHub 网站内容没有抓取到详细信息。让我尝试使用 clawhub CLI 的其他命令，或者检查是否有 API 可以获取更多信息。\n\n让我尝试：\n1. 使用 clawhub search 搜索更多关键词\n2. 检查已安装技能的详细信息\n3. 尝试更新现有技能\n\n实际上，根据任务要求，我需要：\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n\nClawHub CLI 似乎没有提供下载量和更新时间的详细信息。让我尝试直接访问 ClawHub 的 API 或者搜索特定技能。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"ClawHub 网站内容有限。尝试查看 CLI 帮助和搜索更多相关技能："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_564500557cfe4303bb92f8b6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub --help 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_25d823f8b46d4fed9c422ca0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"google calendar\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d3a9fecc5ed24c949260b9cd","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"task management\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7ae910e39ab844c2ac833f21","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"email\" 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":642,"output":241,"cacheRead":17088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17971,"cost":{"input":0.000642,"output":0.0007712000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0034176000000000002,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0048308000000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773373634151}}
{"type":"message","id":"9511ed21","parentId":"a12678c4","timestamp":"2026-03-13T03:47:27.244Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_564500557cfe4303bb92f8b6","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: clawhub [options] [command]\n\nClawHub CLI v0.7.0\ninstall, update, search, and publish agent skills.\n\nOptions:\n  -V, --cli-version                       Show CLI version\n  --workdir <dir>                         Working directory (default: cwd)\n  --dir <dir>                             Skills directory (relative to workdir, default: skills)\n  --site <url>                            Site base URL (for browser login)\n  --registry <url>                        Registry API base URL\n  --no-input                              Disable prompts\n  -h, --help                              display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  login [options]                         Log in (opens browser or stores token)\n  logout                                  Remove stored token\n  whoami                                  Validate token\n  auth                                    Authentication commands\n  search [options] <query...>             Vector search skills\n  install [options] <slug>                Install into <dir>/<slug>\n  update [options] [slug]                 Update installed skills\n  uninstall [options] <slug>              Uninstall a skill\n  list                                    List installed skills (from lockfile)\n  explore [options]                       Browse latest updated skills from the registry\n  inspect [options] <slug>                Fetch skill metadata and files without installing\n  publish [options] <path>                Publish skill from folder\n  delete [options] <slug>                 Soft-delete a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  hide [options] <slug>                   Hide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  undelete [options] <slug>               Restore a hidden skill (moderator/admin only)\n  unhide [options] <slug>                 Unhide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  ban-user [options] <handleOrId>         Ban a user and delete owned skills (moderator/admin only)\n  set-role [options] <handleOrId> <role>  Change a user role (admin only)\n  star [options] <slug>                   Add a skill to your highlights\n  unstar [options] <slug>                 Remove a skill from your highlights\n  sync [options]                          Scan local skills and publish new/updated ones\n\nEnv:\n  CLAWHUB_SITE\n  CLAWHUB_REGISTRY\n  CLAWHUB_WORKDIR\n  (CLAWDHUB_* supported)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":256,"aggregated":"Usage: clawhub [options] [command]\n\nClawHub CLI v0.7.0\ninstall, update, search, and publish agent skills.\n\nOptions:\n  -V, --cli-version                       Show CLI version\n  --workdir <dir>                         Working directory (default: cwd)\n  --dir <dir>                             Skills directory (relative to workdir, default: skills)\n  --site <url>                            Site base URL (for browser login)\n  --registry <url>                        Registry API base URL\n  --no-input                              Disable prompts\n  -h, --help                              display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  login [options]                         Log in (opens browser or stores token)\n  logout                                  Remove stored token\n  whoami                                  Validate token\n  auth                                    Authentication commands\n  search [options] <query...>             Vector search skills\n  install [options] <slug>                Install into <dir>/<slug>\n  update [options] [slug]                 Update installed skills\n  uninstall [options] <slug>              Uninstall a skill\n  list                                    List installed skills (from lockfile)\n  explore [options]                       Browse latest updated skills from the registry\n  inspect [options] <slug>                Fetch skill metadata and files without installing\n  publish [options] <path>                Publish skill from folder\n  delete [options] <slug>                 Soft-delete a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  hide [options] <slug>                   Hide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  undelete [options] <slug>               Restore a hidden skill (moderator/admin only)\n  unhide [options] <slug>                 Unhide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  ban-user [options] <handleOrId>         Ban a user and delete owned skills (moderator/admin only)\n  set-role [options] <handleOrId> <role>  Change a user role (admin only)\n  star [options] <slug>                   Add a skill to your highlights\n  unstar [options] <slug>                 Remove a skill from your highlights\n  sync [options]                          Scan local skills and publish new/updated ones\n\nEnv:\n  CLAWHUB_SITE\n  CLAWHUB_REGISTRY\n  CLAWHUB_WORKDIR\n  (CLAWDHUB_* supported)","cwd":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/zongzhu"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773373647244}}
