: \"1.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1771756867954,\n        \"changelog\": \"humanize-ai-text 1.0.1\\n\\n- No code changes detected in this release.\\n- Documentation and usage instructions remain unchanged.\\n- Maintains compatibility and functionality as described in the previous version.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"youtube-watcher\",\n      \"displayName\": \"YouTube Watcher\",\n      \"summary\": \"Fetch and read transcripts from YouTube videos. Use when you need to summarize a video, answer questions about its content, or extract information from it.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 6,\n        \"downloads\": 28641,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 301,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 293,\n        \"stars\": 206,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769327779866,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769327779866,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of youtube-watcher.\\n\\n- Fetch and read transcripts from YouTube videos.\\n- Summarize videos, answer questions, or extract specific information from transcripts.\\n- Trigger phrases include: \\\"watch youtube\\\", \\\"summarize video\\\", \\\"video transcript\\\", \\\"youtube summary\\\", and \\\"analyze video\\\".\\n- Requires installation of `yt-dlp` for transcript retrieval.\\n- Only works with videos that have closed captions or auto-generated subtitles.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"elite-longterm-memory\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Elite Longterm Memory\",\n      \"summary\": \"Ultimate AI agent memory system for Cursor, Claude, ChatGPT & Copilot. WAL protocol + vector search + git-notes + cloud backup. Never lose context again. Vibe-coding ready.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"ai\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"clawdbot\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"latest\": \"1.2.3\",\n        \"long-term\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"memory\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"openclaw\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"persistence\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 28610,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 242,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 229,\n        \"stars\": 123,\n        \"versions\": 4\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770050243398,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773372049731,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.2.3\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770799020241,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Expanded description and keywords for improved discoverability, highlighting ChatGPT, Copilot, Cursor, and developer tooling.\\n- Updated version to 1.2.3.\\n- Clarified compatibility and marketing text in SKILL.md.\\n- No functional or implementation changes to code logic.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"stock-analysis\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Stock Analysis\",\n      \"summary\": \"Analyze stocks and cryptocurrencies using Yahoo Finance data. Supports portfolio management, watchlists with alerts, dividend analysis, 8-dimension stock scoring, viral trend detection (Hot Scanner), and rumor/early signal detection. Use for stock analysis, portfolio tracking, earnings reactions, crypto monitoring, trending stocks, or finding rumors before they hit mainstream.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"6.2.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 28542,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 253,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 240,\n        \"stars\": 144,\n        \"versions\": 10\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768383975214,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773370943426,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"6.2.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770041353575,\n        \"changelog\": \"🔮 Rumor Scanner: M&A rumors, insider activity, Twitter whispers, impact scoring\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"byterover\",\n      \"displayName\": \"ByteRover\",\n      \"summary\": \"You MUST use this for gathering contexts before any work. This is a Knowledge management for AI agents. Use `brv` to store and retrieve project patterns, dec...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"2.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 4,\n        \"downloads\": 28335,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 128,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 117,\n        \"stars\": 93,\n        \"versions\": 3\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769508805216,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772421886918,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"2.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1772421871970,\n        \"changelog\": \"Version 2.0.0\\n\\n- Major overhaul of documentation: unified guidance, streamlined explanations, and revised quick reference.\\n- Removed separate troubleshooting and workflow files; key guides are now integrated directly into SKILL.md.\\n- Expanded usage scenarios, best practices, and error handling within the main documentation.\\n- Added clear step-by-step setup, command usage, and context management workflows.\\n- Clarified local vs. cloud features and authentication requirements for all commands.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"clawddocs\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Clawdbot Documentation Expert\",\n      \"summary\": \"Clawdbot documentation expert with decision tree navigation, search scripts, doc fetching, version tracking, and config snippets for all Clawdbot features\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.2.2\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 27623,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 374,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 359,\n        \"stars\": 250,\n        \"versions\": 5\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768099309187,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.2.2\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1768244234558,\n        \"changelog\": \"Added YAML frontmatter description for ClawdHub summary display\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"himalaya\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Himalaya\",\n      \"summary\": \"CLI to manage emails via IMAP/SMTP. Use `himalaya` to list, read, write, reply, forward, search, and organize emails from the terminal. Supports multiple accounts and message composition with MML (MIME Meta Language).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 26574,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 982,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 964,\n        \"stars\": 50,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767954271328,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767954271328,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of Himalaya CLI email client skill.\\n\\n- Provides terminal-based email management via IMAP/SMTP.\\n- Supports listing, reading, composing, replying, forwarding, searching, and organizing emails.\\n- Includes multi-account support and message composition with MML.\\n- Detailed setup and configuration instructions included.\\n- Enables handling attachments, output customization, and debugging via logging.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"desktop-control\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Desktop Control\",\n      \"summary\": \"Advanced desktop automation with mouse, keyboard, and screen control\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 26425,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 219,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 207,\n        \"stars\": 185,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770255200863,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773372485812,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770255200863,\n        \"changelog\": \"Version 1.0.0\\n\\n- Initial release of the Desktop Control skill for OpenClaw.\\n- Provides advanced automation: mouse movement/clicks, keyboard input, hotkeys, and typing speed control.\\n- Supports screen capture, region-based screenshots, image/template matching, and pixel color detection.\\n- Includes window management (list, activate, move, resize, minimize/maximize).\\n- Safety features: failsafe abort, logging, approval mode, bounds checks, and emergency pause.\\n- Detailed documentation with examples and complete API reference.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"slack\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Slack\",\n      \"summary\": \"Use when you need to control Slack from Clawdbot via the slack tool, including reacting to messages or pinning/unpinning items in Slack channels or DMs.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 11,\n        \"downloads\": 25837,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 893,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 879,\n        \"stars\": 87,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545378002,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772064940106,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545378002,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"video-frames\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Video Frames\",\n      \"summary\": \"Extract frames or short clips from videos using ffmpeg.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 25302,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 959,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 944,\n        \"stars\": 70,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545391700,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065539606,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545391700,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"trello\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Trello\",\n      \"summary\": \"Manage Trello boards, lists, and cards via the Trello REST API.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 9,\n        \"downloads\": 24127,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 869,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 851,\n        \"stars\": 98,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545389426,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545389426,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"browser-use\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Browser Use\",\n      \"summary\": \"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with w...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.2\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 24050,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 220,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 215,\n        \"stars\": 59,\n        \"versions\": 3\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769388231012,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773371167303,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.2\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1771476812023,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Documentation reworked and simplified for clarity and easier reference.\\n- Audience broadened: Skill now addresses general browser automation, not just sandboxed/cloud use.\\n- Install modes, tunnel setup, and environment variable explanations are removed for a more concise guide.\\n- New dedicated sections for browser modes, session management, essential commands, and Python execution.\\n- Updated and better-organized CLI command reference.\\n- Usage examples and options for real/Chromium/cloud browsers are clarified with practical guidance.\\n- For full advanced setup details, directs users to the official README.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"blogwatcher\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Blogwatcher\",\n      \"summary\": \"Monitor blogs and RSS/Atom feeds for updates using the blogwatcher CLI.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 23840,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 945,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 929,\n        \"stars\": 40,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545299849,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545299849,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"model-usage\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Model Usage\",\n      \"summary\": \"Use CodexBar CLI local cost usage to summarize per-model usage for Codex or Claude, including the current (most recent) model or a full model breakdown. Trigger when asked for model-level usage/cost data from codexbar, or when you need a scriptable per-model summary from codexbar cost JSON.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 23506,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1059,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1039,\n        \"stars\": 85,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767667639455,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065235893,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767667639455,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the model-usage skill for summarizing per-model usage and cost from CodexBar CLI local cost logs.\\n- Supports both Codex and Claude providers.\\n- Allows fetching summaries for the current (most recent) model or all models.\\n- Provides both text and JSON output formats.\\n- Can process costs directly from CodexBar CLI output or from a JSON file/stdin.\\n- Includes guidance for CLI use and script automation.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"darwin\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gmail\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gmail\",\n      \"summary\": \"Gmail API integration with managed OAuth. Read, send, and manage emails, threads, labels, and drafts. Use this skill when users want to interact with Gmail. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.6\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 23210,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 207,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 194,\n        \"stars\": 60,\n        \"versions\": 7\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770021074275,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.6\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770755759017,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Added clawdbot metadata for skill compatibility and requirements.\\n- Declared required environment variable (`MATON_API_KEY`) in the metadata section.\\n- No changes to functional documentation or API usage.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextCursor\": \"07b30d756b7009523943c7f8e53c5629f698954838b84673f7dfd4f9fc5ee8924f77378b362db21abc98538965176c65713d8ad43ad57f857f4cced2124457d6681c42ccf4b9f67a16be3d116bd32e6f0bacb7cb480b92399dc3cd383ded652c273249fad1a81c214f67c253d29916185a38d000e88539d7ee6d48c9e06245497589c7cc9c\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":5252,"aggregated":"- Fetching latest skills\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"self-improving-agent\",\n      \"displayName\": \"self-improving-agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"Captures learnings, errors, and corrections to enable continuous improvement. Use when: (1) A command or operation fails unexpectedly, (2) User corrects Clau...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"3.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 48,\n        \"downloads\": 191561,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2947,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2841,\n        \"stars\": 1893,\n        \"versions\": 14\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767632598365,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773230508805,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"3.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773230308177,\n        \"changelog\": \"Version 3.0.1 – Expanded documentation, clarified workflow, and OpenClaw integration\\n\\n- Major overhaul of SKILL.md with detailed instructions for logging errors, learnings, and feature requests.\\n- Added comprehensive quick reference tables for when and how to log issues and promote learnings.\\n- Included complete setup steps for OpenClaw and generic (non-OpenClaw) agents, with directory structure and file descriptions.\\n- Standardized formats for recording learnings, errors, and feature requests, including metadata and resolution process.\\n- Documented promotion workflow to elevate important learnings to project memory files.\\n- Clarified inter-session communication tools within OpenClaw for sharing and reviewing learnings.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"find-skills\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Find Skills\",\n      \"summary\": \"Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like \\\"how do I do X\\\", \\\"find a skill for X\\\", \\\"is there a skill that can...\\\", or express interest in extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the user is looking for functionality that might exist as an installable skill.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 4,\n        \"downloads\": 186252,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2699,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2653,\n        \"stars\": 778,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773364470184,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the find-skills skill.\\n- Helps users discover and install agent skills when looking for new functionality or extending agent capabilities.\\n- Provides clear guidance on searching for, presenting, and installing skills using Skills CLI commands.\\n- Includes examples and tips for effective skill discovery across common categories like web development, testing, and DevOps.\\n- Offers fallback options when no relevant skills are found, including help with tasks directly and guidance on creating new skills.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"summarize\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Summarize\",\n      \"summary\": \"Summarize URLs or files with the summarize CLI (web, PDFs, images, audio, YouTube).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 11,\n        \"downloads\": 143029,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 3121,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 3067,\n        \"stars\": 555,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773139650650,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"agent-browser\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Agent Browser\",\n      \"summary\": \"A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"automation\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"browser\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"headless\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"latest\": \"0.2.0\",\n        \"web\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 2,\n        \"downloads\": 117645,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2076,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2031,\n        \"stars\": 526,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768170466579,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773370917975,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.2.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1768882342488,\n        \"changelog\": \"**Big update: Expanded documentation and new contribution guidelines.**\\n\\n- Added a CONTRIBUTING.md file with guidelines for contributors.\\n- Significantly revised and expanded SKILL.md:\\n  - Clearer structure, concise “Quick start,” and streamlined “Core workflow.”\\n  - Added or reorganized sections: video recording, mouse control, semantic locators, browser settings, cookies/storage, network, tabs, frames, dialogs, JS, and session state management.\\n  - More comprehensive examples and improved command explanations.\\n- Introduced allowed-tools field in SKILL.md for clearer operational context.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gog\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gog\",\n      \"summary\": \"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 36,\n        \"downloads\": 107838,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2256,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2197,\n        \"stars\": 708,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772180053316,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"github\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Github\",\n      \"summary\": \"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 101802,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2460,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2415,\n        \"stars\": 329,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"ontology\",\n      \"displayName\": \"ontology\",\n      \"summary\": \"Typed knowledge graph for structured agent memory and composable skills. Use when creating/querying entities (Person, Project, Task, Event, Document), linkin...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.4\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 98649,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 222,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 212,\n        \"stars\": 255,\n        \"versions\": 4\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769415435751,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773250316960,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.4\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773249559725,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the ontology skill for typed, constraint-validated knowledge graphs.\\n- Supports entity and relation CRUD, property and relation validation, and graph traversal for common types such as Person, Project, Task, Event, and Document.\\n- Provides schema-driven constraints including required properties, enums, forbidden fields, cardinality, and acyclicity.\\n- Enables multi-step planning and shared memory across skills via structured ontology objects.\\n- Includes CLI tooling for creating, querying, linking, and validating graph data using JSONL storage.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"proactive-agent\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Proactive Agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"Transform AI agents from task-followers into proactive partners that anticipate needs and continuously improve. Now with WAL Protocol, Working Buffer, Autonomous Crons, and battle-tested patterns. Part of the Hal Stack 🦞\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"3.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 19,\n        \"downloads\": 91555,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1324,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1290,\n        \"stars\": 526,\n        \"versions\": 11\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769629545209,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772161938714,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"3.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770259214202,\n        \"changelog\": \"Added: Autonomous vs Prompted Crons, Verify Implementation Not Intent, Tool Migration Checklist\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"weather\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Weather\",\n      \"summary\": \"Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 6,\n        \"downloads\": 87292,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2137,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2100,\n        \"stars\": 272,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545394459,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772616922629,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545394459,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"skill-vetter\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Skill Vetter\",\n      \"summary\": \"Security-first skill vetting for AI agents. Use before installing any skill from ClawdHub, GitHub, or other sources. Checks for red flags, permission scope, and suspicious patterns.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 77206,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1363,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1351,\n        \"stars\": 298,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769863429632,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769863429632,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release - Security-first skill vetting for AI agents\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"self-improving\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Self-Improving + Proactive Agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-reflection + Self-criticism + Self-learning + Self-organizing memory. Agent evaluates its own work, catches mistakes, and improves permanently. Use when...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"lates